# iPhone 18 Pro part b of the weekly set, matrices/dashboard-text-v1.cells: the session anchor row, then Qwen3 4B and
# Gemma 4 E2B on every arm, then the ONNX Runtime GenAI Qwen3 4B rows. The SAME cells, split in two for the night job:
# since 2026-11-04 the iPhone 18 Pro gives its hold back by 08:00 (ops/dashboard-v1/schedule.json iphone18pro
# release_by: the sibling lanes queue for the phone in the morning; the whole set held it 05:30-09:38 on 2026-11-04 and
# 05:30-10:16 on 2026-10-29), and the 05:30 firing leaves 2.5 h, so the job measures the phone's week as two sittings on
# two 05:30 firings, this part first (schedule.json iphone18pro "parts"; docs/dashboard-recurring-job-v1.md §3, "The
# iPhone 18 Pro set in two parts", and §11). The parts are balanced on the two newest sittings' lengths (with the
# preflight and anchor phase: b 2.41 h and a 2.41 h on 2026-10-29, b 2.16 h and a 2.03 h on 2026-11-04) with every arm
# of a model in one part, so a model's cross-arm comparison stays in one session. The anchor row (the first) is the
# session anchor the payload is re-judged on (§4); its Qwen3 0.6B MLX short-chat cell is part a's measurement, which
# runs later in the week. Each sitting has its own anchor phase and admission: no number is pooled across the two
# sessions. Rows are byte-identical to the parent file and in its order (its notes on these rows stay there). An iOS row
# added to the parent goes into its model's part at the same place (scripts/dashboard_job_selftest.py holds the parts to
# the parent).
#   ./bench matrix matrices/dashboard-text-v1-ios-b.cells --platform iphone

ios mlx-swift mlx-community/Qwen3-0.6B-4bit short-chat anchor=1 runs=3

# --- Gemma 4 E2B ---
ios litert-lm litert-community/gemma-4-E2B-it-litert-lm short-chat cooldown=300
ios mlx-swift mlx-community/gemma-4-e2b-it-qat-OptiQ-4bit short-chat cooldown=300
ios mlx-swift mlx-community/gemma-4-e2b-it-4bit short-chat cooldown=300
ios llama.cpp unsloth/gemma-4-E2B-it-GGUF/Q4_K_M short-chat cooldown=300
ios core-ai core-ai/gemma4-e2b-gpu short-chat cooldown=300 exclude=ple-bundle-needs-unpublished-engine-patch
ios litert-lm litert-community/gemma-4-E2B-it-litert-lm long-context-1024-gen256 cooldown=300 context-tokens=2048
ios mlx-swift mlx-community/gemma-4-e2b-it-qat-OptiQ-4bit long-context-1024-gen256 cooldown=300
ios mlx-swift mlx-community/gemma-4-e2b-it-4bit long-context-1024-gen256 cooldown=300
ios llama.cpp unsloth/gemma-4-E2B-it-GGUF/Q4_K_M long-context-1024-gen256 cooldown=300 context-tokens=2048

# --- Qwen3-4B ---
ios mlx-swift mlx-community/Qwen3-4B-4bit short-chat cooldown=300
ios litert-lm litert-community/Qwen3-4B short-chat cooldown=300
ios llama.cpp unsloth/Qwen3-4B-GGUF/Q4_K_M short-chat cooldown=300
ios core-ai core-ai/qwen3-4b-gpu short-chat cooldown=300
ios mlx-swift mlx-community/Qwen3-4B-4bit long-context-1024-gen256 cooldown=300
ios litert-lm litert-community/Qwen3-4B long-context-1024-gen256 cooldown=300 context-tokens=2048
ios llama.cpp unsloth/Qwen3-4B-GGUF/Q4_K_M long-context-1024-gen256 cooldown=300 context-tokens=2048

# --- ONNX Runtime GenAI ---
ios onnxruntime-genai onnx-community/Qwen3-4B-ONNX short-chat backend=cpu cooldown=300 file=onnxruntime/cpu_and_mobile/cpu-int4-kld-block-128 revision=98ddba15d05dede4435afb63f13280abcdbc2a48 context-tokens=2048
ios onnxruntime-genai onnx-community/Qwen3-4B-ONNX long-context-1024-gen256 backend=cpu cooldown=300 file=onnxruntime/cpu_and_mobile/cpu-int4-kld-block-128 revision=98ddba15d05dede4435afb63f13280abcdbc2a48 context-tokens=2048
